      "values:originalText": "(1) The Inspector-General, or a member of the staff of the\nInspector-General, may divulge or communicate IPO information\nto an Ombudsman official if:\n\n(a) the information is relevant to the Ombudsman’s functions or\npowers; and\n\n(b) the Inspector-General is satisfied on reasonable grounds that\nthe Ombudsman has satisfactory arrangements in place for\nprotecting the information."
