      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\nmaterial that is or includes protected\nIPO intercept information\na serious offence punishable by a\nmaximum penalty of imprisonment\nfor 7 years or more, imprisonment\nfor life or the death penalty\nmaterial that is or includes:\n(a) protected IPO stored\ncommunications information; or\n(b) protected IPO\ntelecommunications data\ninformation\na serious offence punishable by a\nmaximum penalty of imprisonment\nfor 3 years or more, imprisonment\nfor life or the death penalty\nOmbudsman Act 1976",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\nmaterial that is or includes protected\nIPO intercept information\na serious offence punishable by a\nmaximum penalty of imprisonment\nfor 7 years or more, imprisonment\nfor life or the death penalty\nmaterial that is or includes:\n(a) protected IPO stored\ncommunications information; or\n(b) protected IPO\ntelecommunications data\ninformation\na serious offence punishable by a\nmaximum penalty of imprisonment\nfor 3 years or more, imprisonment\nfor life or the death penalty\nOmbudsman Act 1976",
