      "values:originalText": "(1A) If:\n\n(a) there is an agreement between Australia and a foreign\ncountry; and\n\n(b) the agreement deals with (among other things) the issue of\norders (however described) by a competent authority\n(however described) of the foreign country;\na copy of the English text of the agreement must not be set out in\nregulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(b) unless a\nstatutory requirements certificate is in force under clause 3B in\nrelation to the foreign country and the agreement.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
