      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.38",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\nmessage application service merely because the person provides a\nbilling service, or a fee collection service, in relation to a message\napplication service.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\nmessage application service merely because the person provides a\nbilling service, or a fee collection service, in relation to a message\napplication service.",
