    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-7-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Storage/back-up service",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-7-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.40",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Schedule, storage/back-up service means a\nservice that enables end-users to store or back-up material, where\nthe uploading of the material for storage or back-up is by means of\na transmission service.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\nstorage/back-up service merely because the person supplies a\ntransmission service that enables material to be uploaded for\nstorage or back-up.\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\nstorage/back-up service merely because the person provides a\nbilling service, or a fee collection service, in relation to a\nstorage/back-up service.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Schedule, storage/back-up service means a\nservice that enables end-users to store or back-up material, where\nthe uploading of the material for storage or back-up is by means of\na transmission service.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\nstorage/back-up service merely because the person supplies a\ntransmission service that enables material to be uploaded for\nstorage or back-up.\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\nstorage/back-up service merely because the person provides a\nbilling service, or a fee collection service, in relation to a\nstorage/back-up service.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-7-2-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-7-2-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-7-2-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bac99c8e2482c62573de70a4a0b961c405ce24fd32347f4793db62b8f7ee03f6"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-7-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 Storage/back-up service",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 40,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Schedule, storage/back-up service means a\nservice that enables end-users to store or back-up material, where\nthe uploading of the material for storage or back-up is by means of\na transmission service.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\nstorage/back-up service merely because the person supplies a\ntransmission service that enables material to be uploaded for\nstorage or back-up.\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\nstorage/back-up service merely because the person provides a\nbilling service, or a fee collection service, in relation to a\nstorage/back-up service."
    },
