      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.40",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\ngeneral electronic content service merely because the person\nprovides a billing service, or a fee collection service, in relation to\na general electronic content service.\n9  When material is posted on a general electronic content service\n\nFor the purposes of this Schedule, material is posted on a general\nelectronic content service by a person if:\n\n(a) the person is an end-user of the service; and\n\n(b) the person causes the material to be accessible to, or\ndelivered to, one or more other end-users using the service.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\ngeneral electronic content service merely because the person\nprovides a billing service, or a fee collection service, in relation to\na general electronic content service.\n9  When material is posted on a general electronic content service\n\nFor the purposes of this Schedule, material is posted on a general\nelectronic content service by a person if:\n\n(a) the person is an end-user of the service; and\n\n(b) the person causes the material to be accessible to, or\ndelivered to, one or more other end-users using the service.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-8-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-8-2-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7cd74df9f8d073186b2aed2ebbbb4d54dab41452431042cd67df0d3e38197066",
      "skos:note": "A person does not provide a general electronic content service merely because they provide a billing service or fee collection service."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-8-2-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8(3) General electronic content service",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 40,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a\ngeneral electronic content service merely because the person\nprovides a billing service, or a fee collection service, in relation to\na general electronic content service.\n9  When material is posted on a general electronic content service\n\nFor the purposes of this Schedule, material is posted on a general\nelectronic content service by a person if:\n\n(a) the person is an end-user of the service; and\n\n(b) the person causes the material to be accessible to, or\ndelivered to, one or more other end-users using the service."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-8-2-ss-3-norm",
