    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-10-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 Uploaded material",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-10-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.41",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Schedule, if:\n\n(a) a person uses a device; and\n\n(b) the device has software that automatically uploads material\nfor storage or back-up by a storage/back-up service; and\n\n(c) as a result, material is automatically uploaded for storage or\nback-up by the storage/back-up service;\nthe person is taken have to uploaded the material for storage or\nback-up by the storage/back-up service.\n10A  When a prescribed communications provider is based in, or\noperates in, a foreign country\nBased in a foreign country—individual\n\n(1) For the purposes of the application of this Schedule to a prescribed\ncommunications provider who is an individual, the provider is\nbased in a foreign country if, and only if, the provider is ordinarily\nresident in the foreign country.\nBased in a foreign country—body corporate\n\n(2) For the purposes of the application of this Schedule to a prescribed\ncommunications provider that is a body corporate, the provider is\nbased in a foreign country if, and only if:\n\n(a) the provider is incorporated in the foreign country; or\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of this Schedule, if:\n\n(a) a person uses a device; and\n\n(b) the device has software that automatically uploads material\nfor storage or back-up by a storage/back-up service; and\n\n(c) as a result, material is automatically uploaded for storage or\nback-up by the storage/back-up service;\nthe person is taken have to uploaded the material for storage or\nback-up by the storage/back-up service.\n10A  When a prescribed communications provider is based in, or\noperates in, a foreign country\nBased in a foreign country—individual\n\n(1) For the purposes of the application of this Schedule to a prescribed\ncommunications provider who is an individual, the provider is\nbased in a foreign country if, and only if, the provider is ordinarily\nresident in the foreign country.\nBased in a foreign country—body corporate\n\n(2) For the purposes of the application of this Schedule to a prescribed\ncommunications provider that is a body corporate, the provider is\nbased in a foreign country if, and only if:\n\n(a) the provider is incorporated in the foreign country; or\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-10-2-ss-1"
        },
