      "cof:title": "14(4) Eligible judge",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 43,
      "values:originalText": "(4) An eligible Judge has, in relation to the performance or exercise of\na function or power conferred on an eligible Judge by this\nSchedule, the same protection and immunity as a Justice of the\nHigh Court has in relation to proceedings in the High Court."
    },
