      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "In determining the meaning of an expression (other than\n“international production order”) used in a provision of this Act\n(other than this Schedule), an expression used in this Schedule is to\nbe disregarded.",
      "skos:definition": "In determining the meaning of an expression (other than\n“international production order”) used in a provision of this Act\n(other than this Schedule), an expression used in this Schedule is to\nbe disregarded.",
      "cml:asserts": [
