      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "This Schedule relies on the Commonwealth’s legislative powers\nunder paragraph 51(v) (communications) of the Constitution.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
