      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0645e5e43a18890269c3f4f54ce8385432f7bb05dbafada8fba079e1598fab43",
      "skos:note": "Application must be made on behalf of the agency by a person or officer"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-33-2-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "33(3) Application for international production order—enforcement of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The application must be made on the criminal law-enforcement\nagency’s behalf by:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(a) if the agency is referred to in subclause 22(3)—a person\nreferred to in that subclause in relation to the agency; or\n\n(b) otherwise:\n\n(i) the chief officer of the agency; or\n\n(ii) an officer of the agency (by whatever name called) who\nholds, or is acting in, an office or position in the agency\nnominated under subclause (4)."
    },
