      "values:originalText": "(3) The chief officer of an enforcement agency may, in writing,\nauthorise persons (including classes of persons) for the purposes of\nsubclause (2). However, each person must be entitled under clause\n42 to make applications on the agency’s behalf.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
