        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-49-ss-5-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "56e9c3ca687adf33ce1b02edf4217d8a76313f6f9e79952c0418cc688e0a3f0c",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of telecommunications data to enforcement agency"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-49-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "49(5) Content of international production order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 78,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\nenforcement agency directly; or\n\n(b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\nenforcement agency indirectly via the Australian Designated\nAuthority."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-49-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
