      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.81",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The application must be made on the control order IPO agency’s\nbehalf by:\n\n(a) if the agency is referred to in subclause 22(3)—a person\nreferred to in that subclause in relation to the agency; or\n\n(b) otherwise:\n\n(i) the chief officer of the agency; or\n\n(ii) an officer of the agency (by whatever name called) who\nholds, or is acting in, an office or position in the agency\nnominated under subclause (4).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The application must be made on the control order IPO agency’s\nbehalf by:\n\n(a) if the agency is referred to in subclause 22(3)—a person\nreferred to in that subclause in relation to the agency; or\n\n(b) otherwise:\n\n(i) the chief officer of the agency; or\n\n(ii) an officer of the agency (by whatever name called) who\nholds, or is acting in, an office or position in the agency\nnominated under subclause (4).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-52"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-52-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-52-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "70ed7bd3040a93e740f19cdfb5a711a6d25854d736d40b887d04fb6bf650f124",
      "skos:note": "Application must be made on behalf of the agency by a person or officer"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-52-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52(3) Application for international production order—control order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 81,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The application must be made on the control order IPO agency’s\nbehalf by:\n\n(a) if the agency is referred to in subclause 22(3)—a person\nreferred to in that subclause in relation to the agency; or\n\n(b) otherwise:\n\n(i) the chief officer of the agency; or\n\n(ii) an officer of the agency (by whatever name called) who\nholds, or is acting in, an office or position in the agency\nnominated under subclause (4)."
    },
