      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to\nintercept communications, the order may require the provider to:\n\n(a) intercept those communications in a specified way; and\n\n(b) make those intercepted communications available to the\ncontrol order IPO agency in a specified way.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to\nintercept communications, the order may require the provider to:\n\n(a) intercept those communications in a specified way; and\n\n(b) make those intercepted communications available to the\ncontrol order IPO agency in a specified way.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-61"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
