          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-61-ss-4-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7996e510bdbae8a9ffcfbc38bfb82e5f1529a54c482a773c777c123efa36bc4f",
      "skos:note": "Communications provider must intercept communications in a specified way and make them available to the control order IPO agency.",
      "dc:description": "Intercepted communications"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-61-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "61(4) Content of international production order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to\nintercept communications, the order may require the provider to:\n\n(a) intercept those communications in a specified way; and\n\n(b) make those intercepted communications available to the\ncontrol order IPO agency in a specified way."
    },
