      "values:originalText": "(7) A requirement under subclause (6) may:\n\n(a) require that intercepted messages, voice calls or video calls\nbe made available to the control order IPO agency directly;\nor\n\n(b) require that intercepted messages, voice calls or video calls\nbe made available to the control order IPO agency indirectly\nvia the Australian Designated Authority.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) A requirement under subclause (6) may:\n\n(a) require that intercepted messages, voice calls or video calls\nbe made available to the control order IPO agency directly;\nor\n\n(b) require that intercepted messages, voice calls or video calls\nbe made available to the control order IPO agency indirectly\nvia the Australian Designated Authority.",
      "values:partOf": {
