    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-69",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "69 Issue of international production order—control order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-69"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies if a control order IPO agency applies, under\nclause 63, to an issuing authority for an international production\norder that:\n\n(a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and\n\n(b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider.\nIssue of international production order\n\n(2) If the issuing authority is satisfied, on the basis of the information\ngiven to the issuing authority under this Division in connection\nwith the application, that:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies if a control order IPO agency applies, under\nclause 63, to an issuing authority for an international production\norder that:\n\n(a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and\n\n(b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider.\nIssue of international production order\n\n(2) If the issuing authority is satisfied, on the basis of the information\ngiven to the issuing authority under this Division in connection\nwith the application, that:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-69-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-69-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-69",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "69 Issue of international production order—control order",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 101,
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies if a control order IPO agency applies, under\nclause 63, to an issuing authority for an international production\norder that:\n\n(a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and\n\n(b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider.\nIssue of international production order\n\n(2) If the issuing authority is satisfied, on the basis of the information\ngiven to the issuing authority under this Division in connection\nwith the application, that:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
