    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "79(3) Content of international production order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-79-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The order must set out the following:\n\n(a) the date on which the order was issued;\n\n(b) the name of the control order IPO agency;\n\n(c) the name of the prescribed communications provider to\nwhom the order is directed;\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(d) the name of the designated international agreement\nnominated in the application for the order;\n\n(e) a statement to the effect that the order is issued on the basis\nof a control order made in relation to a person;\n\n(f) the name of the person;\n\n(g) either:\n\n(i) a statement to the effect that the control order is an\ninterim control order; or\n\n(ii) a statement to the effect that the control order is a\nconfirmed control order.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The order must set out the following:\n\n(a) the date on which the order was issued;\n\n(b) the name of the control order IPO agency;\n\n(c) the name of the prescribed communications provider to\nwhom the order is directed;\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(d) the name of the designated international agreement\nnominated in the application for the order;\n\n(e) a statement to the effect that the order is issued on the basis\nof a control order made in relation to a person;\n\n(f) the name of the person;\n\n(g) either:\n\n(i) a statement to the effect that the control order is an\ninterim control order; or\n\n(ii) a statement to the effect that the control order is a\nconfirmed control order.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0f98fd7ac9d414c5e8a6a00ae060b93c5c98cb9837be2285f69a9199b64f3e92",
      "skos:note": "Must set out specific information in an international production order",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-79-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "79(3) Content of international production order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 114,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The order must set out the following:\n\n(a) the date on which the order was issued;\n\n(b) the name of the control order IPO agency;\n\n(c) the name of the prescribed communications provider to\nwhom the order is directed;\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(d) the name of the designated international agreement\nnominated in the application for the order;\n\n(e) a statement to the effect that the order is issued on the basis\nof a control order made in relation to a person;\n\n(f) the name of the person;\n\n(g) either:\n\n(i) a statement to the effect that the control order is an\ninterim control order; or\n\n(ii) a statement to the effect that the control order is a\nconfirmed control order."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-3-norm",
