        "@id": "values:LegalPerson"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: LegalPerson"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "May",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Permission to disclose data in a specified way.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "79(5) Content of international production order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-79-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:\n\n(a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\ncontrol order IPO agency directly; or\n\n(b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\ncontrol order IPO agency indirectly via the Australian\nDesignated Authority.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:\n\n(a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\ncontrol order IPO agency directly; or\n\n(b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\ncontrol order IPO agency indirectly via the Australian\nDesignated Authority.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ebbc2097ec47437c60c24f04632d44adb0442e02970fb5d83bfbe1a257649ce8",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure requirements for telecommunications data"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-79-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "79(5) Content of international production order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 114,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:\n\n(a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\ncontrol order IPO agency directly; or\n\n(b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\ncontrol order IPO agency indirectly via the Australian\nDesignated Authority."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-5"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "79(6) Content of international production order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-79-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of this clause, a specified way may deal with\nmatters of timing.\nExample: If a requirement under subclause (4) relates to telecommunications\ndata that commences to be held by a prescribed communications\nprovider during a specified period, the requirement may require that\nthe telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO\nagency within 30 minutes after the telecommunications data\ncommences to be held.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) For the purposes of this clause, a specified way may deal with\nmatters of timing.\nExample: If a requirement under subclause (4) relates to telecommunications\ndata that commences to be held by a prescribed communications\nprovider during a specified period, the requirement may require that\nthe telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO\nagency within 30 minutes after the telecommunications data\ncommences to be held.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5edb8d107030258bb7ca35bc26e7bd36e03fc66c2f0468deff2754e4e743248f",
      "skos:note": "Deals with matters of timing for telecommunications data disclosure."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-79-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "79(6) Content of international production order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 114,
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of this clause, a specified way may deal with\nmatters of timing.\nExample: If a requirement under subclause (4) relates to telecommunications\ndata that commences to be held by a prescribed communications\nprovider during a specified period, the requirement may require that\nthe telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO\nagency within 30 minutes after the telecommunications data\ncommences to be held."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
