      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.121",
      "values:originalText": "A written application under clause 83 for an international\nproduction order must set out:\n\n(a) a statement to the effect that the application is made by the\nOrganisation; and\n\n(b) the name of the person making the application on the\nOrganisation’s behalf.",
      "skos:definition": "A written application under clause 83 for an international\nproduction order must set out:\n\n(a) a statement to the effect that the application is made by the\nOrganisation; and\n\n(b) the name of the person making the application on the\nOrganisation’s behalf.",
