      "skos:note": "Written application must set out Organisation's name and person making the application on behalf of the Organisation.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-85",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "85 Contents of application",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 121,
      "values:originalText": "A written application under clause 83 for an international\nproduction order must set out:\n\n(a) a statement to the effect that the application is made by the\nOrganisation; and\n\n(b) the name of the person making the application on the\nOrganisation’s behalf."
    },
