    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-86-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "86(4) Affidavits to accompany written application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-86-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.121",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the application is for an international production order in respect\nof one or more individual message/call application services, the\naffidavit must set out the following information, so far as it can be\nderived from the Organisation’s records:\n\n(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for international\nproduction orders that the Organisation has made under\nclause 83 in relation to those individual message/call\napplication services;\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the application is for an international production order in respect\nof one or more individual message/call application services, the\naffidavit must set out the following information, so far as it can be\nderived from the Organisation’s records:\n\n(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for international\nproduction orders that the Organisation has made under\nclause 83 in relation to those individual message/call\napplication services;\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
