    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-88",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "88 Giving further information to nominated AAT Security Division",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-88"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "member\n\n(1) A nominated AAT Security Division member may require further\ninformation to be given in connection with an application under\nclause 83 to the nominated AAT Security Division member for an\ninternational production order.\n\n(2) The further information:\n\n(a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated AAT\nSecurity Division member directs.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\nSubdivision B—International production orders relating to\ninterception",
      "skos:definition": "member\n\n(1) A nominated AAT Security Division member may require further\ninformation to be given in connection with an application under\nclause 83 to the nominated AAT Security Division member for an\ninternational production order.\n\n(2) The further information:\n\n(a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated AAT\nSecurity Division member directs.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\nSubdivision B—International production orders relating to\ninterception",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-88-ss-1"
        },
        {
