      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.129",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:\n\n(a) require that intercepted communications be made available to\nthe Organisation directly; or\n\n(b) require that intercepted communications be made available to\nthe Organisation indirectly via the Australian Designated\nAuthority.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:\n\n(a) require that intercepted communications be made available to\nthe Organisation directly; or\n\n(b) require that intercepted communications be made available to\nthe Organisation indirectly via the Australian Designated\nAuthority.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
