      "cml:integrityHash": "10384a682da73b58f8aff91ff1be5ce7ac4d34fa0486e4f3cbe5288b388d52a3",
      "skos:note": "Allow written applications with multiple affidavits"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-95-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95(3) Affidavits to accompany written application",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 134,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Despite subclause (1), a written application may be accompanied\nby 2 or more affidavits that together set out each matter that, apart\nfrom this subclause, this clause would have required an affidavit\naccompanying the application to set out."
    },
