      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies to an international production order issued\nunder clause 98.\nContent\n\n(2) The order must be signed by the nominated AAT Security Division\nmember who issued it.\n\n(3) The order must set out the following:\n\n(a) the date on which the order was issued;\n\n(b) the name of the prescribed communications provider to\nwhom the order is directed;\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies to an international production order issued\nunder clause 98.\nContent\n\n(2) The order must be signed by the nominated AAT Security Division\nmember who issued it.\n\n(3) The order must set out the following:\n\n(a) the date on which the order was issued;\n\n(b) the name of the prescribed communications provider to\nwhom the order is directed;\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
