      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.146",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to\ndisclose telecommunications data to the Organisation, the order\nmay require the provider to disclose that data to the Organisation in\na specified way.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to\ndisclose telecommunications data to the Organisation, the order\nmay require the provider to disclose that data to the Organisation in\na specified way.",
      "values:partOf": {
