    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-108-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "108(4) Content of international production order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 146,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to\ndisclose telecommunications data to the Organisation, the order\nmay require the provider to disclose that data to the Organisation in\na specified way."
    },
