    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-108-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "108(5) Content of international production order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-108-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.146",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:\n\n(a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\nOrganisation directly; or\n\n(b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\nOrganisation indirectly via the Australian Designated\nAuthority.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:\n\n(a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\nOrganisation directly; or\n\n(b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\nOrganisation indirectly via the Australian Designated\nAuthority.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-108"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-108-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5ba35176462118977f315b283769ceb39c01a61575637b4dbe59c692f5f87b03",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure requirements for telecommunications data"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-108-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "108(5) Content of international production order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 146,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:\n\n(a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\nOrganisation directly; or\n\n(b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the\nOrganisation indirectly via the Australian Designated\nAuthority."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-108-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-108-ss-5"
