      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-108-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "108(6) Content of international production order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-108-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.146",
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of this clause, a specified way may deal with\nmatters of timing.\nExample: If a requirement under subclause (4) relates to telecommunications\ndata that commences to be held by a prescribed communications\nprovider during a specified period, the requirement may require that\nthe telecommunications data be disclosed to the Organisation within\n30 minutes after the telecommunications data commences to be held.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) For the purposes of this clause, a specified way may deal with\nmatters of timing.\nExample: If a requirement under subclause (4) relates to telecommunications\ndata that commences to be held by a prescribed communications\nprovider during a specified period, the requirement may require that\nthe telecommunications data be disclosed to the Organisation within\n30 minutes after the telecommunications data commences to be held.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-108"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-108-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "af96e5b5e10d0ac94e2df0e2784dfaeec4a154adf5c4dd3fee962057ae56bac3",
      "skos:note": "Deals with matters of timing for telecommunications data disclosure."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-108-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "108(6) Content of international production order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 146,
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of this clause, a specified way may deal with\nmatters of timing.\nExample: If a requirement under subclause (4) relates to telecommunications\ndata that commences to be held by a prescribed communications\nprovider during a specified period, the requirement may require that\nthe telecommunications data be disclosed to the Organisation within\n30 minutes after the telecommunications data commences to be held."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-108-ss-6-norm",
