    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-111-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "111(7) Giving of international production orders—relevant agency",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-111-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.148",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If an international production order is issued under Part 2 or 3 of\nthis Schedule, the relevant agency that applied for the order may\ngive the Australian Designated Authority information that is likely\nto assist the Australian Designated Authority in making a decision\nunder this clause in relation to the order.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If an international production order is issued under Part 2 or 3 of\nthis Schedule, the relevant agency that applied for the order may\ngive the Australian Designated Authority information that is likely\nto assist the Australian Designated Authority in making a decision\nunder this clause in relation to the order.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-111"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
