        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-111-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "461bd5fe96477c79f2d406de33ba47377e52c30d1898868eaec8be2e6f6514d4",
      "skos:note": "Relevant agency may provide information to Australian Designated Authority."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-111-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "111(7) Giving of international production orders—relevant agency",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 148,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If an international production order is issued under Part 2 or 3 of\nthis Schedule, the relevant agency that applied for the order may\ngive the Australian Designated Authority information that is likely\nto assist the Australian Designated Authority in making a decision\nunder this clause in relation to the order.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-111-ss-7-norm",
