      "skos:note": "Agency chief officer may revoke international production order issued in response to agency application."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-114-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "114(1) Revocation of international production orders—relevant agency",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 152,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) an international production order was issued under Part 2 or 3\nof this Schedule; and\n\n(b) the order was issued in response to an application made by a\nrelevant agency;\nthe chief officer of the agency:\n\n(c) may revoke the order; and\n\n(d) must revoke the order if the chief officer is satisfied that the\ngrounds on which the order was issued have ceased to exist."
    },
