    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-114-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "114(3) Revocation of international production orders—relevant agency",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-114-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.152",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of the application of subclause (1) to an\ninternational production order issued under Part 3 of this Schedule\non the ground that a control order was in force in relation to a\nparticular person when the international production order was\nissued, that ground is taken to have ceased to exist if, and only if,\nneither that control order, nor any succeeding control order, is in\nforce.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of the application of subclause (1) to an\ninternational production order issued under Part 3 of this Schedule\non the ground that a control order was in force in relation to a\nparticular person when the international production order was\nissued, that ground is taken to have ceased to exist if, and only if,\nneither that control order, nor any succeeding control order, is in\nforce.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021",
