      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.154",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A revocation under clause 116 takes effect:\n\n(a) if the instrument of revocation is required to be given to the\nprescribed communications provider concerned—when the\ninstrument is given; or\n\n(b) otherwise—when the revocation is made.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A revocation under clause 116 takes effect:\n\n(a) if the instrument of revocation is required to be given to the\nprescribed communications provider concerned—when the\ninstrument is given; or\n\n(b) otherwise—when the revocation is made.",
      "values:partOf": {
