      "skos:note": "Revocation takes effect upon giving of instrument or at the time of revocation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-117-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "117(3) Giving of instrument of revocation—the Organisation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 154,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A revocation under clause 116 takes effect:\n\n(a) if the instrument of revocation is required to be given to the\nprescribed communications provider concerned—when the\ninstrument is given; or\n\n(b) otherwise—when the revocation is made."
    },
