      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) an international production order is revoked under clause 116; and (b) when the revocation takes effect, the Australian Designated Authority has not made a decision about the order under clause 112;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "clause 112 ceases to apply to the order when the revocation takes effect."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-118",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "118 Delegation by the chief officer of a relevant agency",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-118"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.155",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The chief officer of a relevant agency may, by writing, delegate\nany or all of the chief officer’s functions or powers under this Part\nto a certifying officer of the agency.\n\n(2) In performing functions, or exercising powers, under a delegation\nunder subclause (1), the delegate must comply with any directions\nof the chief officer.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The chief officer of a relevant agency may, by writing, delegate\nany or all of the chief officer’s functions or powers under this Part\nto a certifying officer of the agency.\n\n(2) In performing functions, or exercising powers, under a delegation\nunder subclause (1), the delegate must comply with any directions\nof the chief officer.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-118-ss-1"
        },
        {
