      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.156",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(a) the Australian Designated Authority gave an international\nproduction order to the prescribed communications provider\nto whom the order is directed; and\n\n(b) the order was subsequently cancelled under subclause (1);\nthe Australian Designated Authority must:\n\n(c) give the instrument of cancellation to the prescribed\ncommunications provider; and\n\n(d) do so as soon as practicable after cancelling the order.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(a) the Australian Designated Authority gave an international\nproduction order to the prescribed communications provider\nto whom the order is directed; and\n\n(b) the order was subsequently cancelled under subclause (1);\nthe Australian Designated Authority must:\n\n(c) give the instrument of cancellation to the prescribed\ncommunications provider; and\n\n(d) do so as soon as practicable after cancelling the order.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-122"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-122-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-122-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b471b8ac49c282bb07597a369d0e44673a737b39fdf6a16d5c8f1cdce75ed2e2",
      "skos:note": "Must provide instrument of cancellation to prescribed communications provider after cancelling order.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-122-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "122(4) Cancellation of international production orders",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 156,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(a) the Australian Designated Authority gave an international\nproduction order to the prescribed communications provider\nto whom the order is directed; and\n\n(b) the order was subsequently cancelled under subclause (1);\nthe Australian Designated Authority must:\n\n(c) give the instrument of cancellation to the prescribed\ncommunications provider; and\n\n(d) do so as soon as practicable after cancelling the order."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-122-ss-4-norm",
