    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-122-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "122(6) Cancellation of international production orders",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-122-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.156",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) an international production order is cancelled under this\nclause; and\n\n(b) when the cancellation takes effect, the Australian Designated\nAuthority has not made a decision about the order under\nclause 111 or 112 (as the case may be);\nclause 111 or 112 (as the case may be) ceases to apply to the order\nwhen the cancellation takes effect.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If:\n\n(a) an international production order is cancelled under this\nclause; and\n\n(b) when the cancellation takes effect, the Australian Designated\nAuthority has not made a decision about the order under\nclause 111 or 112 (as the case may be);\nclause 111 or 112 (as the case may be) ceases to apply to the order\nwhen the cancellation takes effect.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-122"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-122-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "340c2b1cd2a67db46e3c0ab478feacf1734909ed8531aea48c6a8b4ce1e62180",
      "skos:note": "Cancellation of international production orders"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-122-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "122(6) Cancellation of international production orders",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 156,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) an international production order is cancelled under this\nclause; and\n\n(b) when the cancellation takes effect, the Australian Designated\nAuthority has not made a decision about the order under\nclause 111 or 112 (as the case may be);\nclause 111 or 112 (as the case may be) ceases to apply to the order\nwhen the cancellation takes effect."
    },
