      "values:originalText": "(3) The period for which the chief officer of a relevant agency must\ncause a particular item to be kept in the agency’s records under\nsubclause (1) is the period:\n\n(a) starting when the item came into existence; and\n\n(b) ending:\n\n(i) when 3 years have elapsed since the item came into\nexistence; or\n\n(ii) when the Ombudsman gives a report to the Minister\nunder clause 150 that is about records that include the\nitem;\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
