      "values:originalText": "(3) Before inspecting records of the Australian Designated Authority\nunder this clause, the Ombudsman must give reasonable notice to\nthe Australian Designated Authority of when the inspection will\noccur.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Before inspecting records of the Australian Designated Authority\nunder this clause, the Ombudsman must give reasonable notice to\nthe Australian Designated Authority of when the inspection will\noccur.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
