    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-144-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "144(3) Power to obtain relevant information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-144-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.184",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A requirement under subclause (1) or (2) to attend before an\ninspecting officer must specify:\n\n(a) a place for the attendance; and\n\n(b) a period within which, or a time and day when, the\nattendance is to occur.\nThe place, and the period or the time and day, must be reasonable\nhaving regard to the circumstances in which the requirement is\nmade.\nOffence",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A requirement under subclause (1) or (2) to attend before an\ninspecting officer must specify:\n\n(a) a place for the attendance; and\n\n(b) a period within which, or a time and day when, the\nattendance is to occur.\nThe place, and the period or the time and day, must be reasonable\nhaving regard to the circumstances in which the requirement is\nmade.\nOffence",
