      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.187",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 11A of the Ombudsman Act 1976 does not apply in\nrelation to the exercise or proposed exercise of a power, or the\nperformance or the proposed performance of a function, of the\nOmbudsman under this Part.",
