    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-146-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "146(3) Application of Ombudsman Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-146-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.187",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to clause 145, subsections 35(2), (3), (4) and (8) of the\nOmbudsman Act 1976 apply for the purposes of this Part and so\napply as if:\n\n(a) a reference in those subsections to an officer were a reference\nto an inspecting officer; and\n\n(b) a reference in those subsections to information did not\ninclude a reference to protected information; and\n\n(c) a reference in those subsections to that Act were a reference\nto this Part; and\n\n(d) paragraph 35(3)(b) of that Act were omitted; and\n\n(e) section 35A of that Act had not been enacted.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subject to clause 145, subsections 35(2), (3), (4) and (8) of the\nOmbudsman Act 1976 apply for the purposes of this Part and so\napply as if:\n\n(a) a reference in those subsections to an officer were a reference\nto an inspecting officer; and\n\n(b) a reference in those subsections to information did not\ninclude a reference to protected information; and\n\n(c) a reference in those subsections to that Act were a reference\nto this Part; and\n\n(d) paragraph 35(3)(b) of that Act were omitted; and\n\n(e) section 35A of that Act had not been enacted.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-146"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-146-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-146-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ad02524617438031ff336d7db14c63c1214568a0e8bddc1300a4532c99f761a8",
      "skos:note": "Application of Ombudsman Act to this Part"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-146-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "146(3) Application of Ombudsman Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 187,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to clause 145, subsections 35(2), (3), (4) and (8) of the\nOmbudsman Act 1976 apply for the purposes of this Part and so\napply as if:\n\n(a) a reference in those subsections to an officer were a reference\nto an inspecting officer; and\n\n(b) a reference in those subsections to information did not\ninclude a reference to protected information; and\n\n(c) a reference in those subsections to that Act were a reference\nto this Part; and\n\n(d) paragraph 35(3)(b) of that Act were omitted; and\n\n(e) section 35A of that Act had not been enacted."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-146-ss-3-norm",
