    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-147",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "147 Exchange of information between Ombudsman and",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-147"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.187",
      "values:originalText": "State/Territory inspecting authorities\n\n(1) If the Ombudsman has obtained under this Part information\nrelating to an authority of a State or Territory, the Ombudsman\nmay give the information to another authority of that State or\nTerritory (an inspecting authority) that:\n\n(a) has powers under the law of that State or Territory; and\n\n(b) has the function of making inspections of a similar kind to\nthose provided for in clause 142 when the inspecting\nauthority is exercising those powers.\n\n(2) However, the Ombudsman may give the information only if the\nOmbudsman is satisfied that giving the information is necessary to\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "State/Territory inspecting authorities\n\n(1) If the Ombudsman has obtained under this Part information\nrelating to an authority of a State or Territory, the Ombudsman\nmay give the information to another authority of that State or\nTerritory (an inspecting authority) that:\n\n(a) has powers under the law of that State or Territory; and\n\n(b) has the function of making inspections of a similar kind to\nthose provided for in clause 142 when the inspecting\nauthority is exercising those powers.\n\n(2) However, the Ombudsman may give the information only if the\nOmbudsman is satisfied that giving the information is necessary to\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-147-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-147-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "40584630d97f3ebb95592f0378c81fc3f6b9e52a200a02e5ef6ec84e3b0ef8d2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-147",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "147 Exchange of information between Ombudsman and",
      "values:kind": "section",
