    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-148",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "148 Delegation by Ombudsman",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-148"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.188",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Ombudsman may, by writing, delegate:\n\n(a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or\n\n(b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the\nOmbudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an\nemployee responsible to that person;\nall or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Part other than a\npower to report to the Minister.\n\n(2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise\nof any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of\ndelegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the\nperson.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Ombudsman may, by writing, delegate:\n\n(a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or\n\n(b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the\nOmbudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an\nemployee responsible to that person;\nall or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Part other than a\npower to report to the Minister.\n\n(2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise\nof any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of\ndelegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the\nperson.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-148-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-148-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b2734f4ca8818ded8e7c27959f5e7b4e52a0ce0973228bdc33e959de9f7e1f3b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-148",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "148 Delegation by Ombudsman",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 188,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Ombudsman may, by writing, delegate:\n\n(a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or\n\n(b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the\nOmbudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an\nemployee responsible to that person;\nall or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Part other than a\npower to report to the Minister.\n\n(2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise\nof any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of\ndelegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the\nperson."
    },
