      "cml:premiseText": "The Ombudsman is not liable to an action... for or in relation to an act done, or omitted to be done...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Therefore, the Ombudsman is not liable..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-149-logic-cogai-5",
