      "values:originalText": "(5) If, as a result of an inspection under this Part of the records of a\nrelevant agency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an officer\nof the relevant agency has contravened a provision of this\nSchedule, the Ombudsman may include in the Ombudsman’s\nreport on the inspection a report on the contravention.",
