    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-150-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "150(8) Reports",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-150-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.188",
      "values:originalText": "(8) A report under this clause must not include information which, if\nmade public, could reasonably be expected to:\n\n(a) endanger a person’s safety; or\n\n(b) prejudice an investigation or prosecution; or\n\n(c) compromise any relevant agency’s operational activities or\nmethodologies.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(8) A report under this clause must not include information which, if\nmade public, could reasonably be expected to:\n\n(a) endanger a person’s safety; or\n\n(b) prejudice an investigation or prosecution; or\n\n(c) compromise any relevant agency’s operational activities or\nmethodologies.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-150"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
