    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-166",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "166 Evidentiary certificates—Australian Designated Authority",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-166"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.215",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Australian Designated Authority may issue a written\ncertificate signed by the Australian Designated Authority setting\nout such facts as the Australian Designated Authority considers\nrelevant with respect to:\n\n(a) giving an international production order to a prescribed\ncommunications provider; or\n\n(b) giving an instrument of revocation of an international\nproduction order to a prescribed communications provider; or\n\n(c) giving an instrument of cancellation to a prescribed\ncommunications provider.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Australian Designated Authority may issue a written\ncertificate signed by the Australian Designated Authority setting\nout such facts as the Australian Designated Authority considers\nrelevant with respect to:\n\n(a) giving an international production order to a prescribed\ncommunications provider; or\n\n(b) giving an instrument of revocation of an international\nproduction order to a prescribed communications provider; or\n\n(c) giving an instrument of cancellation to a prescribed\ncommunications provider.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-166-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-166-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1607a562e3c9269811ad1345e02d4eb928a28f0d7eaff63f8eaacfe1cf299b3b",
      "skos:note": "Issue written certificate with specified facts."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-166",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "166 Evidentiary certificates—Australian Designated Authority",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 215,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Australian Designated Authority may issue a written\ncertificate signed by the Australian Designated Authority setting\nout such facts as the Australian Designated Authority considers\nrelevant with respect to:\n\n(a) giving an international production order to a prescribed\ncommunications provider; or\n\n(b) giving an instrument of revocation of an international\nproduction order to a prescribed communications provider; or\n\n(c) giving an instrument of cancellation to a prescribed\ncommunications provider.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-166-norm",
