    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-169",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "169 Interaction with the Privacy Act 1988",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-169"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.219",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of the Privacy Act 1988, if:\n\n(a) there is a designated international agreement between\nAustralia and one or more foreign countries; and\n\n(b) the agreement deals with (among other things):\n\n(i) the issue of orders (however described); or\n\n(ii) the making of requests (however described);\n\nby a competent authority (however described) of such a\nforeign country;\nthe disclosure of information in compliance with any such order or\nrequest, to the extent that the information contains personal\ninformation, is taken to be a disclosure that is authorised by this\nAct.",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of the Privacy Act 1988, if:\n\n(a) there is a designated international agreement between\nAustralia and one or more foreign countries; and\n\n(b) the agreement deals with (among other things):\n\n(i) the issue of orders (however described); or\n\n(ii) the making of requests (however described);\n\nby a competent authority (however described) of such a\nforeign country;\nthe disclosure of information in compliance with any such order or\nrequest, to the extent that the information contains personal\ninformation, is taken to be a disclosure that is authorised by this\nAct.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-169-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-169-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-169-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-169-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-169-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-169-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2efd0e83327471d775ac515653f4dc058495e7e156a5a0a517c43d29110a4f06",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information is authorized if it complies with an order or request from a foreign country under a designated international agreement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-169",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "169 Interaction with the Privacy Act 1988",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 219,
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of the Privacy Act 1988, if:\n\n(a) there is a designated international agreement between\nAustralia and one or more foreign countries; and\n\n(b) the agreement deals with (among other things):\n\n(i) the issue of orders (however described); or\n\n(ii) the making of requests (however described);\n\nby a competent authority (however described) of such a\nforeign country;\nthe disclosure of information in compliance with any such order or\nrequest, to the extent that the information contains personal\ninformation, is taken to be a disclosure that is authorised by this\nAct."
    },
    {
