      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.219",
      "values:originalText": "•\nThis Part deals with miscellaneous matters, such as:\n\n(a)\nelectronic service of documents; and\n\n(b)\ncertified copies of international production orders; and\n\n(c)\ndelegations.",
      "skos:definition": "•\nThis Part deals with miscellaneous matters, such as:\n\n(a)\nelectronic service of documents; and\n\n(b)\ncertified copies of international production orders; and\n\n(c)\ndelegations.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-170-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "79185ae63439eb17867265de6f5d4951e2c883f6b077794e4d361562d742f88d",
      "skos:note": "Simplified outline of this Part"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-170",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "170 Simplified outline of this Part",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 219,
      "values:originalText": "•\nThis Part deals with miscellaneous matters, such as:\n\n(a)\nelectronic service of documents; and\n\n(b)\ncertified copies of international production orders; and\n\n(c)\ndelegations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-170-norm",
