    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-171",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "171 Electronic service of documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-171"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.219",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given\nto a person by the Australian Designated Authority:\n\n(i) an international production order;\n\n(ii) a certified copy of an international production order;\n\n(iii) an instrument of revocation of an international\nproduction order;\n\n(iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international\nproduction order; and\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given\nto a person by the Australian Designated Authority:\n\n(i) an international production order;\n\n(ii) a certified copy of an international production order;\n\n(iii) an instrument of revocation of an international\nproduction order;\n\n(iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international\nproduction order; and\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-171-norm"
        },
        {
