    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-180",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "180 Minor defects in connection with international production order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-180"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.226",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) information is purportedly obtained in accordance with an\ninternational production order; and\n\n(b) there is a defect or irregularity in relation to the international\nproduction order; and\n\n(c) apart from that defect or irregularity, the information would\nhave been obtained in accordance with the international\nproduction order;\nthe information is taken to have been obtained in accordance with\nthe international production order.\n\n(2) For the purposes of subclause (1), a defect or irregularity in\nrelation to an international production order means a defect or\nirregularity:\n\n(a) that is not a substantial defect or irregularity; and\n\n(b) that is:\n\n(i) in, or in connection with the issue of, a document\npurporting to be the international production order; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(ii) in connection with compliance with the international\nproduction order; or\n\n(iii) in connection with purported compliance with a\ndocument purporting to be the international production\norder.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) information is purportedly obtained in accordance with an\ninternational production order; and\n\n(b) there is a defect or irregularity in relation to the international\nproduction order; and\n\n(c) apart from that defect or irregularity, the information would\nhave been obtained in accordance with the international\nproduction order;\nthe information is taken to have been obtained in accordance with\nthe international production order.\n\n(2) For the purposes of subclause (1), a defect or irregularity in\nrelation to an international production order means a defect or\nirregularity:\n\n(a) that is not a substantial defect or irregularity; and\n\n(b) that is:\n\n(i) in, or in connection with the issue of, a document\npurporting to be the international production order; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(ii) in connection with compliance with the international\nproduction order; or\n\n(iii) in connection with purported compliance with a\ndocument purporting to be the international production\norder.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-180-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-180-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a69bb044fc1baa694c0becf29027ce56d9b2fcbf1143df455e819bc56f6d97ae"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021#sch-1-sec-180",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "180 Minor defects in connection with international production order",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 226,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) information is purportedly obtained in accordance with an\ninternational production order; and\n\n(b) there is a defect or irregularity in relation to the international\nproduction order; and\n\n(c) apart from that defect or irregularity, the information would\nhave been obtained in accordance with the international\nproduction order;\nthe information is taken to have been obtained in accordance with\nthe international production order.\n\n(2) For the purposes of subclause (1), a defect or irregularity in\nrelation to an international production order means a defect or\nirregularity:\n\n(a) that is not a substantial defect or irregularity; and\n\n(b) that is:\n\n(i) in, or in connection with the issue of, a document\npurporting to be the international production order; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 78, 2021\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production\nOrders) Act 2021\n\n(ii) in connection with compliance with the international\nproduction order; or\n\n(iii) in connection with purported compliance with a\ndocument purporting to be the international production\norder."
    },
